        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Oil Rubbed Bronze Inge Offset 12 Inch Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade from durable stainless steel, the Inge Oil Rubbed Bronze 12 Inch Door Pull is suitable for commercial and residential installation. Choose from back to back, thru-bolt, and surface mounting. If you order back to back mounting, make sure you order two door pulls. The Oil Rubbed Bronze finish of the Inge Offset 12 Inch Door Handle is a deep, dark brown that almost appears black. This Offset Pull has a 13-1/4 inch overall length and 12 inch mounting centers.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNeed a different size?  <a href=\"/products/inge-oil-rubbed-bronze-24-inch-door-pull\"><b>24 Inge Inch Door Pull</b></a> or <a href=\"/products/inge-oil-rubbed-bronze-36-inch-door-pull\"><b>36 Inge Inch Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Round Offset Doorware Designs RDOPULL12-613:\r\n<ul>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\"></a>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Grade Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Oil Rubbed Bronze</b></li> \r\n<li>Total Length: 13-1/4\" (337mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 12\" (305mm) C/C</li>\r\n<li>Grip Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Offset: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 3\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Can be installed on fiberglass, wood, glass, and metal doors.\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with removable round rosettes.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-RDOPULL12-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262424\"><b>DWD-RDOPULL12 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Inge Oil Rubbed Bronze 12 Inch Door Pull",
                "description": "Made from durable stainless steel, the Inge Oil Rubbed Bronze 12 Inch Door Pull is suitable for commercial and residential installation. Choose from back to back, thru-bolt, and surface mounting. If you order back to back mounting, make sure you order two door pulls. The Oil Rubbed Bronze finish of the Inge Offset 12 Inch Door Handle is a deep, dark brown that almost appears black. This Offset Pull has a 13-1/4 inch overall length and 12 inch mounting centers.",
